' Studio's Search and Problems fixture (Preview 4 S3, S5): a project of
' four files. main.rr includes the modules in order; Counter, a global,
' is used in every file; StartServer, a SUB of server.rr, is called here;
' Srv is an RServerSocket, which works on the desktop only. Opened in
' Studio by the flows, never run.
$APPTYPE GUI
$INCLUDE "globals.rr"
$INCLUDE "server.rr"
$INCLUDE "ui.rr"

Counter = 0
StartServer
MainForm.ShowModal
